{
  "id": "fox-shffl-shine",
  "name": "SHFFL shine",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": [
    "fox"
  ],
  "goal": "SHFFL an aerial, then shine as you land.",
  "why": "An aerial on a shield or a crouching opponent leaves Fox in landing lag next to them. A shine on the first frame the L-cancelled lag allows leaves them the shortest gap Fox can give there, its hitbox is out on its first frame, and the jump out of it starts the next action.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 90,
      "height": 8
    },
    "what": "A SHFFL shine is a short hop, an aerial, a fast fall and an L-cancel, then down-B on the first frame the landing lag allows.",
    "expect": "Each attempt is judged when the shine comes out: the short hop, the aerial, the fast fall, the landing lag, and how many frames after the lag the shine came. After misses, the coach shows your inputs frame by frame against these frames. A jump out of the shine that lands without an aerial is not counted.",
    "example": [
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "A",
        "frame": "J+1",
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": "SA",
        "hold": 3
      },
      {
        "press": "L",
        "frame": "SA+2",
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": 24
      },
      {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 24
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: X tapped. Short hop",
      "J+1": "Frame {J+1}: A. Neutral air",
      "SA": "Frame {SA}: stick down. Fast fall",
      "SA+2": "Frame {SA+2}: L",
      "SA+3": "Frame {SA+3}: landed. {7} frames of landing lag",
      "SA+10": "Frame {SA+10}: down-B. Shine"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "The SHFFL",
        "text": [
          "A SHFFL is a short hop, an aerial, a fast fall and an L-cancel. The aerial is pressed on frame {J+1}, the first frame in the air, and the fast fall at the top of the short hop, frame {SA}, so Fox lands with the aerial still out.",
          "Landing during an aerial gives its landing lag: {15} frames for neutral air, {18} for down air. L, R or Z pressed on the landing frame or on any of the {6} frames before it halves it: {7} and {9} frames."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "A",
                "frame": "J+1",
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": "SA",
                "hold": 3
              },
              {
                "press": "L",
                "frame": "SA+2",
                "hold": 1
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: X tapped. Short hop",
              "J+1": "Frame {J+1}: A. Neutral air",
              "SA": "Frame {SA}: the top. Stick tapped down: fast fall",
              "SA+2": "Frame {SA+2}: L pressed",
              "SA+3": "Frame {SA+3}: landed. Landing lag {7} frames",
              "SA+10": "Frame {SA+10}: free to act"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  "J"
                ],
                "words": "Short hop",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+1",
                  "SA-4"
                ],
                "words": "Neutral air",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA-3",
                  "SA+3"
                ],
                "words": "Press L now: L-cancel",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA+4",
                  "SA+9"
                ],
                "words": "Landing lag",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA+10",
                  "SA+20"
                ],
                "words": "Free to act",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Shine as the landing lag ends",
        "text": [
          "Landing lag cannot be cancelled: down-B pressed during it is ignored, and holding it does not carry the press over. The shine comes out when down-B is pressed on the first frame after the lag, frame {SA+10} here.",
          "The lag depends on the aerial: an L-cancelled neutral air ends {7} frames after landing, a down air {9}, a back air {10}, a forward air {11}."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "A",
                "frame": "J+1",
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": "SA",
                "hold": 3
              },
              {
                "press": "L",
                "frame": "SA+2",
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": 24
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": 24
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "SA+3": "Frame {SA+3}: landed, L-cancelled",
              "SA+4": "Frame {f}: landing lag. Down-B now is ignored",
              "SA+10": "Frame {SA+10}: down-B. The shine comes out",
              "SA+11": "Frame {f}: shine"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA+3",
                  "SA+9"
                ],
                "words": "Landing lag: a shine is ignored",
                "kind": "late"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA+10",
                  "SA+10"
                ],
                "words": "Shine now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA+11",
                  "SA+24"
                ],
                "words": "Shine",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
